<title>USA: TABLE-Friede Goldman Q2 pro forma net rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Friede Goldman Q2 pro forma net rises.</headline>
<dateline>JACKSON, Miss. 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Friede Goldman International Inc</p>
<p>				     Q2		     Six months</p>
<p>			     1996	 1997	 1996	 1997</p>
<p> Revenue		  $5,582    $26,869     $8,547    $45,523</p>
<p> Gross Profit	    1,764     10,245	2,303     16,099</p>
<p> Operating Income	  395	6,747	 ( 9)	9,979</p>
<p> Net income		  529	8,472	3,712     13,030</p>
<p>Pro forma net income(1)</p>
<p>				 333	6,177	2,338	9,050</p>
<p> Earnings per share     0.06	 0.92	 0.40	 1.42</p>
<p> Pro forma net income   0.04	 0.67	 0.25	 0.98</p>
<p>(per share)</p>
<p>Weighted average shares outstanding</p>
<p>			 9,200,000  9,200,000  9,200,000  9,200,000</p>
<p>	    (In thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>NOTE: Company says when the effects of gains from the sale and distribution of assets and settlement proceeds, which are not expected to recur, are excluded, pro forma net income for the 1997 periods were $4.1 million, or $0.45 per share, for Q2, and $6.1 million, or $0.67 per share, for six months.</p>
<p>((--New York Newsdesk 212 859-1700))</p>
